Description: Client-side 'DataSHIELD' package that orchestrates the federated
    estimation of the average treatment effect (ATE) across multiple independent
    randomised controlled trials (RCTs), each held on a separate data server.
    Implements the generalised difference estimator of Khellaf, Bellet and Josse
    (2025) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2404.18962>, including delta-method variance
    estimation and optional adjustment for study-specific intercept shifts.
